title: "Unlimited OCR Everywhere"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained Jupyter notebooks, a batch CLI and an SGLang server guide for
  running Baidu's Unlimited-OCR-2 on Google Colab T4, Colab Pro L4/A100,
  Windows/Linux NVIDIA GPUs, CPU-only laptops and Apple Silicon.
